{#
  look-shoot.njk
  ----------------
  A helper for taking the 35 photos for the look-around About page with a
  webcam. A dot lights up in each of 7 x 5 positions on the screen; you
  look at it, and a photo is taken. At the end you can preview the effect
  right here and download all the photos as one zip, already named the way
  the About page expects (look-0-0.jpg ... look-6-4.jpg).

  Everything happens in your browser: the photos are never uploaded
  anywhere. Behaviour is in assets/js/lookshoot.js.
#}

<div class="shoot" data-shoot data-cols="7" data-rows="5">

  <div class="shoot__intro" data-intro>
    <h1>Photo shoot helper</h1>
    <video class="shoot__video-big" data-video-big muted playsinline hidden></video>
    <ol>
      <li>Sit about an arm's length from the screen, with even light on your face and the camera at eye level.</li>
      <li>Turn on the camera and check you are centred.</li>
      <li>A dot lights up and shrinks. Turn your head (not only your eyes) so your nose points at it. The photo is taken when it is smallest.</li>
      <li>Keep your shoulders still. It takes about a minute. Space pauses, Backspace redoes the last dot, Esc stops.</li>
    </ol>
    <p data-message></p>
    <div class="shoot__buttons">
      <button class="shoot__button" type="button" data-camera>Turn on camera</button>
      <button class="shoot__button" type="button" data-start hidden>Start the photos</button>
    </div>
    <p>Your photos stay in your browser. Nothing is uploaded.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="shoot__grid" data-grid aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <video class="shoot__video" data-video muted playsinline></video>
  <div class="shoot__hud"><span data-status></span><span data-progress></span></div>
  <div class="shoot__flash" data-flash></div>

  <div class="shoot__done" data-done hidden>
    <h2>All photos taken</h2>
    <p>Preview how it moves, then download the photos. Unzip them and put all of them in <code>src/assets/img/look/</code> in your project.</p>
    <div class="shoot__buttons">
      <button class="shoot__button" type="button" data-preview>Preview the effect</button>
      <button class="shoot__button" type="button" data-download>Download photos (zip)</button>
      <button class="shoot__button shoot__button--ghost" type="button" data-retake>Start over</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="look shoot__preview" data-look-stage data-manual data-cols="7" data-rows="5" hidden>
    <canvas class="look__canvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <button class="shoot__button shoot__button--ghost shoot__close" type="button" data-close-preview>Close preview</button>
  </section>

</div>
